Živjo,

da dopolnim obvestilo, 9.aprila pa so objavili readr <http://blog.rstudio.org/2015/04/09/readr-0-1-0/>, še prej pa haven <http://blog.rstudio.org/2015/03/04/haven-0-1-0/>.

Na blogu pišejo, da "readr makes it easy to read many types of tabular data...Compared to the equivalent base functions, readr functions are around 10x faster. They’re also easier to use because they’re more consistent, they produce data frames that are easier to use (no more stringsAsFactors = FALSE!), they have a more flexible column specification, and any parsing problems are recorded in a data frame", glede haven pa da "makes it easy to read data from SAS, SPSS and Stata".

lep pozdrav, Miha

